                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e2dbf2d0-fbf4-3e78-bf9f-5af689ddf06e",
                        "entry_id": "322d5afd-af31-35a1-889f-4c9f3dbb9325",
                        "glosses": [
                            "uninhabited"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7fc3eca2-2163-4245-9d6b-28095633408e",
                                "sense_id": "e2dbf2d0-fbf4-3e78-bf9f-5af689ddf06e",
                                "text": "Необозри́мое, блестя́ще-жёлтое по́ле замыка́лось то́лько с одно́й стороны́ высо́ким, сине́ющим ле́сом, кото́рый тогда́ каза́лся мне са́мым отдалённым, таи́нственным ме́стом, за кото́рым и́ли конча́ется свет, и́ли начина́ются необита́емые стра́ны.",
                                "translation": "The immeasurable, bright yellow field was closed in only on one side by a tall, bluish forest which then appeared to me as a most distant and mysterious place, beyond which either the world came to an end, or uninhabitable countries began.",
                                "english": "The immeasurable, bright yellow field was closed in only on one side by a tall, bluish forest which then appeared to me as a most distant and mysterious place, beyond which either the world came to an end, or uninhabitable countries began."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
